{"4812030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aeriea", "steam_appid": 4812030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to launch our playtest in August.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add the game to your Wishlist for instant alerts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your custom-built fortress isle, crush monster swarms, and escape Aeriea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aeriea</strong> is a casual action game built around core gameplay of <strong>Fortress Building + Roguelike + Survivor</strong>. With easy-to-learn controls and near-endless combat combinations, experience the unique thrill of marching your fortress straight into battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/8edaa63831f1a44914a8296fd0f615f5.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/8edaa63831f1a44914a8296fd0f615f5.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/8edaa63831f1a44914a8296fd0f615f5.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a group of hospitalized children wake up to find themselves transported to Aeriea, a mysterious realm made of floating islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besieged by hordes of vicious monsters, they are forced to arm themselves and construct defensive fortresses to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they dig deeper into the truth, the kids uncover everything is a scheme orchestrated by an almighty giant dubbed the Creator. Curiously, the Creator seems amused by their struggles, alternately tormenting and lending them aid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they find a way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and pilot your very own fortress isle across a map spanning nearly 1500 buildable tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, turrets, ramparts, contraptions, traps and more—over a hundred construction modules await you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineer the ultimate defensive stronghold to fend off incoming foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 distinct weapons are available in-game already, each with unique stats and exclusive upgrade paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may equip multiple weapons at once, with further loadout slots unlockable as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and mix different armaments to discover unexpected synergies with your floating fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level &amp; map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features procedurally spliced map generation: every run links your fortress isle to randomly generated terrain, so no two playfields are identical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each battle also comes with a unique event timeline that spawns random quests, enemy waves and unexpected crises for fresh challenges every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro Tip: Roam boldly when ahead in battle, but retreat to your fortress isle for shelter whenever things take a turn for the worse!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to launch our playtest in August.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add the game to you