agraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/eb101bbc39664441d7927980e17fd482.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and pilot your very own fortress isle across a map spanning nearly 1500 buildable tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, turrets, ramparts, contraptions, traps and more—over a hundred construction modules await you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineer the ultimate defensive stronghold to fend off incoming foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/affb8f238e40df47087b107f821e5539.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 distinct weapons are available in-game already, each with unique stats and exclusive upgrade paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may equip multiple weapons at once, with further loadout slots unlockable as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and mix different armaments to discover unexpected synergies with your floating fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.poster.avif?t=1785720541\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.webm?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/extras/7712332f06d58125de066b7337686e37.mp4?t=1785720541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level &amp; map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features procedurally spliced map generation: every run links your fortress isle to randomly generated terrain, so no two playfields are identical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each battle also comes with a unique event timeline that spawns random quests, enemy waves and unexpected crises for fresh challenges every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro Tip: Roam boldly when ahead in battle, but retreat to your fortress isle for shelter whenever things take a turn for the worse!</p>", "short_description": "DRIVE YOUR FORTRESS TO THE BATTLEFIELD! This casual action game centers around Fortress Building + Roguelike + Survivor core gameplay. Enjoy endlessly fun combat with simple, intuitive controls!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4812030/f3493910dbb5fe1982bfde21114be30e3d480149/header.jpg?t=178572054